flowchart TB
  O[Operator]
  Entry[Standalone entrypoints - operator chat - logs - status]
  Plugin[Optional thin Herdr plugin front door]
  O --> Entry
  Plugin -.->|opens existing entrypoints| Entry
  subgraph Brain[Herdr Brain - standalone control plane requiring Herdr]
    Meaning[Envelope and meaning - addresses - identity - authority - record]
    Receiver[Durable inbox and receiver dedupe - eventId and producer epoch sequence]
    Seam[One narrow transport seam]
    Adapter[One active swappable adapter - existing quiet-gated delivery first]
    Meaning <--> Receiver
    Meaning --> Seam --> Adapter
  end
  Entry --> Meaning
  subgraph Runtime[Herdr - physical runtime]
    Physical[Panes - agent state - input - events]
  end
  Adapter -->|exact runtime binding and permitted envelope pointer| Physical
  Physical -->|receipt states precisely what was delivered| Adapter
  Future[Later upstream proposal - deliver to agent X when idle and return a receipt]
  Future -.->|would replace the delivery edge| Physical
  Swap[Fence intake - spool arrivals - drain in-flight delivery - retain IDs and receipts - reverse the same way]
  Swap --- Seam
  Guard[Refusal holds that action - no automatic adapter fallback - no exactly-once model claim]
  Guard --- Adapter
